mlxflow 0.8
1. Read Files   tickets/; pattern=*.txt
2. <each draft_one; on_error=skip>   [file] -> [text]
     1. Read Text     (input:1)
     2. <list kb_answer>   text -> text
          1. Read Index                 support-kb.index
          2. Embed        (input:1)     BGE-M3
          3. Retrieve     (1,2)         top_k=5
          4. Template     (3,input:1)   "Context:\n{1}\n\nCustomer:\n{2}\n\n Draft
                                        the reply."
          5. Answer                     Qwen3 8B
     3. Gate                      Ministral 3B; "Safe and correct to send
                                  as-is? tags: send, unsure"
        -> { send: 5 | unsure: 4 }
     4. Human Input               "Fix or rewrite this draft:"; timeout=8h ; default=unchanged
     5. Template                  "{1}"
3. Join Text    separator="\n\n===\n\n"
4. Save Text    replies-review.md
